e source theorem or any nontrivial local obligation. Contract premises H004 and conclusion are both True, and plan T001 is True despite being mapped to all eight source steps. No conditional statements representing the source inferences exist for assembly to discharge; successful elaboration only verifies this vacuous type.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/3\"},{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/4\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/premises/3\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/conclusion\"},{\"document\":\"type-Check.lean\",\"pointer\":\"/6\"},{\"document\":\"type-result.json\",\"pointer\":\"/stdout\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/steps/0\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/terminal\"}]}},\"findings\":[{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"explanation\":\"H004 has been replaced by True. The actual Lean binders contain no V, complex Lie operators, highest-weight vector, dimension assertion, lattice basis/embedding, or divided-power admissibility. Accordingly the proposal does not encode the source assumptions about an arbitrary admissible lattice.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"spec.json\",\"pointer\":\"/hypotheses/3\"},{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/3\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/premises/3/type\"},{\"document\":\"type-Check.lean\",\"pointer\":\"/6\"}]},{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"explanation\":\"Source conclusion P asserts irreducibility of M tensor_Z K. The actual contract conclusion and elaborated Lean result are True, and there is no source-facing theorem type or output map proving P.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/4\"},{\"document\":\"source-map.json\",\"pointer\":\"/source_outputs/P\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/conclusion/type\"},{\"document\":\"type-Check.lean\",\"pointer\":\"/6\"},{\"document\":\"type-result.json\",\"pointer\":\"/stdout\"}]},{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"explanation\":\"T001 is True while purporting to cover S001–S008. It exports none of the source's intermediate mathematical conclusions, so the plan is not a typed implementation of the accepted argument route and has no meaningful internal hypotheses to discharge.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/inferences/0/argument\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/steps/0/source_steps\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/steps/0/statement\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/terminal\"}]},{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"explanation\":\"No typed representation or conversion obligations realize the source's M tensor_Z K construction or S004 basis/action correspondence. Empty objects/shared obligations and the placeholder representation label cannot establish these identifications.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/inferences/0/argument/3\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/representation\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/objects\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/shared_obligations\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/representation_notes\"}]}]}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessib